=== cj-e1: cj-10 the other way round: no index on the second table ===
Cannot push join: no suitable index on join columns for table 'cj_ord'. Create a primary key, unique index, or ordered index on the join columns.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: No suitable index for join columns.

=== cj-e2: an equality under an OR is no join key ===
Table 'cj_nation' is joined with a comma, without ON conditions. Only a CTE without GROUP BY, which has at most one row, can be joined that way.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Comma cross joins are supported only for CTEs without GROUP BY. Join tables and grouped CTEs with JOIN ... ON.

=== cj-e3: the two columns of the equality have different types ===
Join columns 's_nation' and 'b_id' must have identical type, precision, scale, length and character set: NDB pushed joins do not convert linked values.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Join column type mismatch.

=== cj-e4: a query without aggregates ===
This query has no aggregate expression, so it is not an aggregate query.
Currently, RonSQL only supports aggregate queries and projection-only
SELECTs: single-table, left-deep join chains over real tables and/or
complete-key CTE lookups (INNER / LEFT JOIN), comma cross-joins of
scalar CTEs, and CTE_SCAN roots — all without GROUP BY /
expressions (ORDER BY and LIMIT are supported).
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Not an aggregate query.

